
# --- Amberline secret-hygiene standard (08/31/2026) ---
# Env files in every form, including editor swap and backup copies. A vim swap
# of .env (.env.swp) once leaked keys into GitHub history; these patterns and
# the gitleaks pre-commit hook exist so that never repeats.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!.env.template
!.env.sample
*.sw[a-p]
.*.sw[a-p]
*~
.#*
\#*#
*.orig
*.rej
Session.vim
.netrwhist
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
*.jks
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
.netrc
.DS_Store
._*
.claude/settings.local.json
# --- end standard block ---
